"data to efficiently size detection regions. The grid is automatically built "
"over time from tracked object data."
msgstr ""
"The region வலைவாய் is an உகப்பாக்கம் that learns where objects of different "
"sizes typically appear in each camera's புலம் of view. Frigate uses this "
"தகவல்கள் பெறுநர் efficiently அளவு detection regions. The வலைவாய் is "
"automatically built வீச்சலகு time இருந்து tracked பொருள் data."

